  arithmetic, dedupe, projection. Keeping it framework-free means the hard part is testable without a DOM, and the UI
  stays a thin hand-rolled render over it. A framework would add a build step and buy nothing a task list needs.

  [1mModule boundaries[0m, organized so the core has no idea a browser exists:

  ┌─────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┬─────────────────┐
